window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>From<i> New York Times </i>best-selling author L.P. Dover comes an enchanting world of Fae magic and pulse-pounding passion. </p> <p>Five years ago, Meliantha, the Summer Court Princess, was spurned by the man she loves. Heart shattered, she fell into the arms of Finn, a fierce and handsome warrior. While he accepts she can never love him, more than anything he longs to mend her broken heart.</p> <p>As the Winter Solstice Ball approaches, Meliantha knows she must face Prince Kalen, her former love, once more. She fears she won’t make it out with her heart intact, yet is left stunned when the Winter Prince seems completely enraptured by her once more. Someone is playing games with her. And Meliantha refuses to be their pawn. </p> <p>Surrounded by betrayals and deceit, the Princess must uncover who stands to win in this twisted web of lies. Time is running out. Every player is in place. Can Meliantha uncover the truth and spare them all? Or will the malicious dark sorcerer drain her of her power…and her love?</p>"; 
